{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"request:00000000000000000105:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a16afca4bf70a1a4ba236a996780fa\",\"output\":\"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"FigCraft figcraft-cli download Linux headless\\\",\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://figcraft.run/mcp\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"FigCraft MCP Server: Let AI Agents Design UI\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Get `figcraft-cli`: on macOS it is the separate `figcraft-cli-0.6.0-macos-universal.zip` release download; the Linux .deb and .rpm install it as `/usr/bin/figcraft-cli`; the Windows installer and portable zip include `figcraft-cli.exe`. ... claude mcp add figcraft -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp ... drive the running app (start it with: figcraft --control 7979) ... claude mcp add figcraft-app -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp --attach 7979\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://figcraft.net/guides/figcraft-mcp-claude\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"FigCraft MCP: Let Claude Design Screens in FigCraft\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Get figcraft-cli\\\\nThe MCP server is part of the desktop downloads, not the web editor. ... - **macOS:** download `figcraft-cli-<version>-macos-universal.zip` from the\\\\nFigCraft downloads and unzip it.\\\\n- **Linux AppImage:** the AppImage bundles the CLI — ... `FigCraft.AppImage cli mcp` works wherever `figcraft-cli mcp` appears below.\\\\n- **From source:** `cargo build --release -p figcraft-cli` and use\\\\n`target/release/figcraft-cli`.\\\\nUse the **absolute path** to the CLI in the steps below.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1792108800},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pasqualepillitteri.it/en/news/23599/figcraft-guide-free-figma-alternative-rust\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"FigCraft guide, the free Figma alternative written in Rust\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"In headless mode it runs without a window, with a document in memory; in attached mode it drives the open app, so whoever sits in front of the screen sees each edit appear live. ... claude mcp add figcraft -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp ... drives the open app (started with figcraft --control 7979) ... claude mcp add figcraft-app -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp --attach 7979\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1792022400},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/storytold/figcraft\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"GitHub - storytold/figcraft: FigCraft: interface design and prototyping; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of collaborative design workflows in pure Rust\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"figcraft-cli render landing.figcraft -o landing.png --scale 2\\\\nfigcraft-cli export landing.figcraft -o out/ --format svg ... figcraft-cli run build-card.json --out card.figcraft ... figcraft-cli commands --filter autoLayout ... figcraft-cli mcp\\\\nfigcraft-cli mcp --attach 47800\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://removetext.video/blog/what-is-figcraft\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"What Is FigCraft? Features, Download & FigCraft AI\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"How to Download FigCraft and Get Started\\\\nIf you want to try the **open-source design editor**, use the ArtCraft FigCraft page or the GitHub releases linked from its repository. Do not confuse these with the download page for the unrelated AI image-and-video app. ... **Choose your platform.** Official downloads cover macOS, Windows, and Linux, with additional builds described in the repository.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1792108800},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://figcraft.net/\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"FigCraft Online – Free Open-Source Figma Alternative in Your Browser\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"claude mcp add figcraft -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp ... figcraft --control 7979\\\\nclaude mcp add figcraft-app -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp --attach 7979 ... FigCraft vs Figma\\\\n- ### Linux designers\\\\n    Figma has no Linux app. FigCraft ships AppImage, .deb, .rpm and Flatpak builds.\\\\nFigma alternatives for Linux\\\\n- ### Leaving Sketch ... FigCraft vs Sketch\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://deepwiki.com/zeqinlee/figcraft/7.1-build-system-and-distribution\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Build System & Distribution | zeqinlee/figcraft | DeepWiki\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"| **Local Install** | `npm install figcraft` | Programmatic library usage in projects | Via `npx figcraft` | ... | **Global Install** | `npm install -g figcraft` | Syst…","truncated":true}
